// field or method was accepted by `bit check` with exit 0, and only failed
// later, at lowering, with a spanless "cannot lower 1 function(s)" naming
// main. Originally lived in _tests_/bit/checkercases/ because the diagnostic
// was newer than the pinned stage0 oracle at the time. #3399 moved it here
// once stage0 was repinned to 0.1.22 (2026-08-18), which includes #2641's
